1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,167 --> 00:00:36,450
(Divine Era, Lunisolar Calendar,
Yingmei Day)

3
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,290
(Above Yuanyang Continent,)

4
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,700
(there are two forces in this world.)

5
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:44,080
(The Yang Force comes
from the Chi Dragon.)

6
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:46,540
(The Yin Force comes
from the Turbid Dragon.)

7
00:00:48,410 --> 00:00:50,500
(The two dragons ruled Mount Buzhou
and Dazedi.)

8
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:54,450
(Thousands of years ago,)

9
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,330
(the two dragons fought.)

10
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:59,410
(That battle tore heaven
and earth apart.)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:02,639
(The Chi Dragon won
a devastating victory)

12
00:01:02,681 --> 00:01:03,790
(and transformed
into the Eye of Heaven.)

13
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:05,750
(The Turbid Dragon was defeated,)

14
00:01:05,910 --> 00:01:07,330
(and vanished into the cracks
of heaven and earth,)

15
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:08,660
(falling into silence.)

16
00:01:09,370 --> 00:01:10,830
(Only one Reverse Scale remained.)

17
00:01:11,250 --> 00:01:12,160
(The broken scale sank into the abyss.)

18
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:15,500
(The Chi Dragon sealed the Turbid Dragon's
Reverse Scale beneath the Ice Lake)

19
00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:18,910
(and sent two fierce beasts,
Cang and Yi, to guard it.)

20
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,179
(Anyone who came
for the Reverse Scale...)

21
00:01:21,221 --> 00:01:22,059
(Die.)

22
00:01:22,101 --> 00:01:23,970
=Episode 4=
(Get the Scale)

23
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:26,580
(Ice Lake)

24
00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:27,660
(Ice Lake)
(Meanwhile, in Dazedi,)

25
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,700
(a legend has been passed down
for generations.)

26
00:01:31,790 --> 00:01:32,580
(The Reverse Scale)

27
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:36,620
(has been waiting for the one)

28
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,250
(chosen by destiny to claim it.)

29
00:01:43,542 --> 00:01:46,200
(Lu Ji)

30
00:01:53,417 --> 00:01:55,917
(Medicine Lodge)

31
00:02:02,250 --> 00:02:03,389
If you don't want to die,

32
00:02:03,431 --> 00:02:04,200
don't move.

33
00:02:07,750 --> 00:02:10,160
I've used extreme cold energy
to protect your heart core.

34
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,620
Who are you?

35
00:02:15,830 --> 00:02:18,290
Everyone here calls me Master Lu.

36
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,080
Where am I?

37
00:02:30,250 --> 00:02:31,540
Even if he survives,

38
00:02:32,290 --> 00:02:34,500
he'll be crippled for life.

39
00:02:34,950 --> 00:02:35,910
Master Lu,

40
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,580
is there really no other way?

41
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:42,000
Unless you go beneath the Ice Lake
and retrieve the Reverse Scale.

42
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:44,120
But no one has ever succeeded.

43
00:02:44,830 --> 00:02:45,620
No matter what,

44
00:02:45,870 --> 00:02:46,950
we have to try.

45
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:11,059
Yan.

46
00:03:11,101 --> 00:03:11,750
Look!

47
00:03:13,370 --> 00:03:14,910
That should be the Reverse Scale.

48
00:03:15,250 --> 00:03:16,019
Take it,

49
00:03:16,061 --> 00:03:17,290
and that kid can be saved.

50
00:03:26,250 --> 00:03:27,410
Move!

51
00:03:27,620 --> 00:03:28,769
We're here for the Scale.

52
00:03:28,811 --> 00:03:30,349
Scale seekers.

53
00:03:30,391 --> 00:03:32,160
We always welcome scale seekers here.

54
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,099
It's been a long time
since we had guests.

55
00:03:34,141 --> 00:03:36,120
Are you two here
to admire the ice sculptures?

56
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:37,620
We're not interested in ice sculptures.

57
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,479
Looking at you,

58
00:03:39,521 --> 00:03:41,229
maybe I should take you to the agency

59
00:03:41,271 --> 00:03:42,660
and make a sand sculpture out of you.

60
00:03:43,950 --> 00:03:45,250
You think you can mock me?

61
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:49,120
I'll show you who's boss around here.

62
00:03:53,370 --> 00:03:54,979
Every scale seeker

63
00:03:55,021 --> 00:03:57,950
is a one-of-a-kind collection piece.

64
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:09,179
The Turbid Dragon injured
your heart meridian.

65
00:04:09,221 --> 00:04:10,660
That's why they brought you here.

66
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:12,370
To protect it,

67
00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:15,120
you must destroy your foundation.

68
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:18,330
Destroy my foundation?

69
00:04:18,580 --> 00:04:19,580
What will happen?

70
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,120
You will become like everyone else.

71
00:04:22,370 --> 00:04:23,330
Carry water and cook meals.

72
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,200
Farm the land.

73
00:04:26,410 --> 00:04:27,830
Live an ordinary life.

74
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:31,750
But since the moment
they took my sister away,

75
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,950
I could never live
an ordinary life again.

76
00:04:41,660 --> 00:04:42,700
Then there's another way.

77
00:04:44,950 --> 00:04:46,450
Retrieve the Turbid Dragon's
Reverse Scale.

78
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:47,910
The Reverse Scale?

79
00:04:48,910 --> 00:04:49,750
What is that?

80
00:04:53,290 --> 00:04:54,290
A dragon is born with scales,

81
00:04:54,410 --> 00:04:55,410
with countless aligned scales
and one Reverse Scale.

82
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:58,580
When dragon power flows outward,
the normal scales open.

83
00:04:59,330 --> 00:05:01,790
When dragon power is withdrawn,
the Reverse Scale closes.

84
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,370
A thousand years ago,

85
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:07,249
the Turbid Dragon's Reverse Scale
was torn away.

86
00:05:07,291 --> 00:05:08,580
Its dragon power could only be released,
never contained.

87
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:10,040
That is why it damaged
your heart meridian.

88
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:11,660
Retrieve the Reverse Scale,

89
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:13,290
and the dragon power will regain its
balance between release and restraint.

90
00:05:13,910 --> 00:05:16,040
Then you can fully wield the power
of Turbid Dragon.

91
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:19,290
And the injury to your heart meridian
will heal on its own.

92
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,429
It's about time.

93
00:06:19,471 --> 00:06:20,370
Stop stalling.

94
00:06:20,870 --> 00:06:21,660
Got it.

95
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:23,830
You're the one who stalls the most.

96
00:06:27,550 --> 00:06:29,080
Just wait to die.

97
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,330
Come taste our local ice storm.

98
00:06:51,540 --> 00:06:52,330
Duo Mu!

99
00:06:54,330 --> 00:06:55,809
(Yan, where are you?)

100
00:06:55,851 --> 00:06:56,830
Duo Mu!

101
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,160
(Yan.)

102
00:07:03,910 --> 00:07:04,700
Duo Mu!

103
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,540
Try this!

104
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:13,000
I'm here!

105
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:20,450
I'm here!

106
00:07:22,580 --> 00:07:23,660
(Yan.)

107
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:27,830
Don't you watch your back
when you fight?

108
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:35,450
Ultimate finishing move!

109
00:07:49,330 --> 00:07:51,410
Let me add a little something extra.

110
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:58,290
(Yan, where are you?)

111
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:05,790
Duo Mu.

112
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,370
(Yan, I'm too late.)

113
00:08:16,410 --> 00:08:18,370
An ice sculpture of a beauty
and a beast.

114
00:08:18,660 --> 00:08:19,910
My finest masterpiece.

115
00:08:37,290 --> 00:08:38,120
Master Lu.

116
00:08:39,330 --> 00:08:40,250
The medicine is ready.

117
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:43,450
Has no one ever retrieved
the Reverse Scale before?

118
00:08:45,830 --> 00:08:46,849
Kid,

119
00:08:46,891 --> 00:08:48,389
do you think

120
00:08:48,431 --> 00:08:49,950
you're the one chosen by destiny?

121
00:08:50,410 --> 00:08:53,000
Don't think you're special
just because you're young.

122
00:08:53,370 --> 00:08:54,950
(Zhu Si)
You dare challenge fate itself.

123
00:08:54,950 --> 00:08:56,080
(Zhu Si)

124
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,059
(Zhu Si)
You've truly been poisoned

125
00:08:57,101 --> 00:08:59,580
(Zhu Si)
by those rebellious ideas.

126
00:09:01,660 --> 00:09:03,100
That's Zhu Si.

127
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:05,700
His eldest son died
in the Ice Lake years ago.

128
00:09:07,450 --> 00:09:08,410
And you

129
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:11,750
don't even know how you awakened
the power of Turbid Dragon.

130
00:09:12,370 --> 00:09:14,250
Your eight extraordinary meridians
must still be blocked.

131
00:09:14,950 --> 00:09:16,750
You have no chance of retrieving
the Reverse Scale.

132
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,370
Many children

133
00:09:20,950 --> 00:09:21,679
once believed

134
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:24,080
they were one of a kind.

135
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:26,830
Only later do they realize

136
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:28,809
they are but a speck

137
00:09:28,851 --> 00:09:30,830
of dust among countless lives.

138
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:32,580
So?

139
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:35,750
Will you return to your ordinary life,

140
00:09:36,290 --> 00:09:37,660
or go to your death?

141
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:39,660
The choice is yours.

142
00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:42,620
Even a speck of dust

143
00:09:43,750 --> 00:09:45,120
has its own moment to shine.

144
00:09:48,830 --> 00:09:50,200
I...

145
00:09:51,830 --> 00:09:52,700
want to try.

146
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,950
What is his connection to your agency?

147
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:02,750
He's our escort job.

148
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,700
We're taking him to the Capital.

149
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,540
I'll help you.

150
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:13,700
I just can't bear to see another soul
filled with resentment in this world.

151
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,979
This ice silkworm

152
00:10:17,021 --> 00:10:18,500
produces icy threads

153
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:20,790
that can temporarily
mend your heart meridian.

154
00:10:21,250 --> 00:10:22,830
It will stop the monster power
from backfiring

155
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:24,580
and keep you alive long enough

156
00:10:24,910 --> 00:10:25,950
to reach the Ice Lake.

157
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,059
Are all you youngsters

158
00:10:35,101 --> 00:10:36,580
this stubborn?

159
00:10:36,910 --> 00:10:38,450
Do you really have to walk straight
into a dead end?

160
00:10:45,250 --> 00:10:47,040
Cang and Yi are not invincible.

161
00:10:48,830 --> 00:10:50,250
Someone once defeated them.

162
00:10:51,620 --> 00:10:52,450
Lu Yuanqing,

163
00:10:54,330 --> 00:10:55,580
if you make it out,

164
00:10:55,950 --> 00:10:57,120
remember this:

165
00:10:57,830 --> 00:11:00,370
obtaining the Reverse Scale
is not the end.

166
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:08,583
(Lu Yuanqing)

167
00:11:13,542 --> 00:11:16,208
♪Days flow on♪

168
00:11:16,208 --> 00:11:19,410
♪Countless days♪
(Lu Yuanqing)

169
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:22,000
Ugly thing, let them go.

170
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:26,479
What a lucky day.

171
00:11:26,521 --> 00:11:27,700
Another one came right to me.

172
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,269
Kiddo,

173
00:11:29,311 --> 00:11:31,580
are you here to save them
or claim the Reverse Scale?

174
00:11:31,830 --> 00:11:33,500
The people and the Reverse Scale...

175
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,080
I'll take them both.

176
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:38,375
♪You speak without a sound♪

177
00:11:39,625 --> 00:11:41,792
♪Nothing was ever wrong♪

178
00:11:57,542 --> 00:11:59,083
♪I long for impermanence♪

179
00:11:59,870 --> 00:12:02,000
Give up. Why bother?

180
00:12:04,250 --> 00:12:06,200
♪Life and death, weariness♪

181
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,700
Then die!

182
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:10,625
♪Fate comes to rest♪

183
00:12:10,625 --> 00:12:14,542
♪One stroke, barren land♪

184
00:12:14,542 --> 00:12:18,167
♪One stroke, heaven's time♪

185
00:12:18,167 --> 00:12:21,667
♪No one was ever there♪

186
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:25,250
♪A lifetime has already passed♪

187
00:12:37,250 --> 00:12:38,080
(Cold.)

188
00:12:38,700 --> 00:12:39,950
(So cold.)

189
00:12:41,790 --> 00:12:42,660
Talk!

190
00:12:43,750 --> 00:12:44,790
Where are the offerings?

191
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,200
Say it!

192
00:12:50,500 --> 00:12:51,639
Lu,

193
00:12:51,681 --> 00:12:54,479
you dare steal the gods' offerings?

194
00:12:54,521 --> 00:12:55,370
Hand them over!

195
00:13:06,450 --> 00:13:07,790
If you can't return the offerings,

196
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,620
kneel here!

197
00:13:09,830 --> 00:13:11,059
Even if you freeze to death,

198
00:13:11,101 --> 00:13:12,660
that is the gods' will!

199
00:13:21,790 --> 00:13:25,950
Xiaoyue, wait for me to come home.

200
00:13:28,870 --> 00:13:30,910
(Can I borrow your fire?)

201
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:33,950
Fire?

202
00:13:35,410 --> 00:13:37,599
In this frozen wasteland,

203
00:13:37,641 --> 00:13:38,870
where would fire come from?

204
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:51,450
(The fire is within you.)

205
00:13:53,500 --> 00:13:56,370
(The eight extraordinary meridians
begin at the sea of energy)

206
00:13:56,500 --> 00:13:57,870
(and end at the heart meridian.)

207
00:13:58,450 --> 00:14:00,830
(Only by knowing the source
of your power)

208
00:14:01,290 --> 00:14:03,410
(can you truly control it.)

209
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:06,160
(Open all eight meridians,)

210
00:14:06,450 --> 00:14:09,250
(and you will understand where
your Turbid Dragon comes from.)

211
00:14:10,330 --> 00:14:11,639
(I remember now.)

212
00:14:11,681 --> 00:14:12,450
(It's fire.)

213
00:14:13,330 --> 00:14:15,540
(The fire is in my heart.)

214
00:14:18,583 --> 00:14:21,292
♪Fate comes to rest♪

215
00:14:22,375 --> 00:14:25,250
♪One stroke, barren land♪

216
00:14:25,792 --> 00:14:28,625
♪One stroke, heaven's time♪

217
00:14:29,625 --> 00:14:32,167
♪No one was ever there♪

218
00:14:33,333 --> 00:14:36,000
♪A lifetime has already passed♪

219
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,330
How's that possible?

220
00:14:38,550 --> 00:14:40,160
This ice cannot be melted,
not even by fire.

221
00:14:40,450 --> 00:14:42,290
What kind of power does he possess?

222
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,769
(The Reverse Scale)

223
00:14:46,811 --> 00:14:49,250
(has been waiting for)

224
00:14:49,950 --> 00:14:51,580
(the one chosen by destiny.)

225
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:54,458
♪I long for impermanence♪

226
00:14:55,660 --> 00:14:57,700
I should thank you for your icy power.

227
00:14:58,160 --> 00:15:00,160
It helped me open my eight
extraordinary meridians.

228
00:15:02,750 --> 00:15:05,583
♪Fate comes to rest♪

229
00:15:06,625 --> 00:15:09,500
♪One stroke, barren land♪

230
00:15:09,500 --> 00:15:11,830
♪One stroke, heaven's time♪

231
00:15:11,830 --> 00:15:13,500
(My Reverse Scale)

232
00:15:13,500 --> 00:15:15,910
(shall remain in your keeping for now.)

233
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:19,200
(When the cracks between
heaven and earth open once more,)

234
00:15:19,330 --> 00:15:23,200
(I shall return.)

235
00:15:24,917 --> 00:15:26,042
♪Life is the lover of death♪

236
00:15:26,042 --> 00:15:27,750
♪Not its opposite♪

237
00:15:28,292 --> 00:15:29,167
♪If we are steeped♪

238
00:15:29,375 --> 00:15:31,542
♪In the amniotic waters of the world♪

239
00:15:32,125 --> 00:15:33,125
♪Nothing was ever there♪

240
00:15:33,500 --> 00:15:35,000
♪Why should we hold on♪

241
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:38,080
A dragon lurks in the abyss,
its Reverse Scale still sealed.

242
00:15:39,708 --> 00:15:40,417
♪If the ground is split open♪

243
00:15:40,917 --> 00:15:42,375
♪A face is revealed♪

244
00:15:43,208 --> 00:15:43,875
♪The tears she shed♪

245
00:15:43,875 --> 00:15:46,040
♪Have drowned our eyes♪

246
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:50,020
One day, it shall defy fate
and cut down the Immortal Altar.

247
00:16:05,833 --> 00:16:08,000
♪I long for impermanence♪

248
00:16:09,292 --> 00:16:11,833
♪The square and circle become poetry♪

249
00:16:12,875 --> 00:16:15,417
♪Life and death, weariness♪

250
00:16:16,625 --> 00:16:19,458
♪Fate comes to rest♪

251
00:16:20,458 --> 00:16:23,167
♪One stroke, barren land♪

252
00:16:23,917 --> 00:16:26,660
♪One stroke, heaven's time♪

253
00:16:26,660 --> 00:16:28,410
Your children are not possessed.

254
00:16:28,790 --> 00:16:30,950
They simply don't want their children

255
00:16:31,410 --> 00:16:32,910
to spend their whole lives

256
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:35,120
bowing their heads as you do.

257
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:35,875
♪Summer is noon♪

258
00:16:35,875 --> 00:16:37,833
♪And winter is the long night♪

259
00:16:38,792 --> 00:16:39,750
♪Life is the lover of death♪

260
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:41,667
♪Not its opposite♪

261
00:16:42,333 --> 00:16:43,000
♪If we are steeped♪

262
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,292
♪In the amniotic waters of the world♪

263
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,083
♪Nothing was ever there♪

264
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,290
Young hero.

265
00:16:50,950 --> 00:16:53,160
Young hero.

266
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:54,910
Young hero.

267
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:56,409
If you reach the Capital

268
00:16:56,451 --> 00:16:57,519
and meet my son,

269
00:16:57,561 --> 00:16:58,660
give this to him.

270
00:16:59,700 --> 00:17:01,410
My youngest son is called Zhu Ahai.

271
00:17:01,540 --> 00:17:04,389
This sesame cake was made by his mother.

272
00:17:04,431 --> 00:17:05,330
It's his favorite.

273
00:17:12,917 --> 00:17:14,700
♪Your impermanence♪

274
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:15,579
My lord,

275
00:17:15,621 --> 00:17:16,750
the boy from Dazedi

276
00:17:17,080 --> 00:17:19,200
has emerged from the Ice Lake.

277
00:17:19,330 --> 00:17:21,620
He also took the Reverse Scale from it.

278
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,179
Someone from the Medicine Lodge

279
00:17:23,221 --> 00:17:24,160
brought him back to life.

280
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:30,790
The Medicine Lodge
is a den of corruption.

281
00:17:32,330 --> 00:17:33,870
It should have been dealt with long ago.

282
00:17:37,950 --> 00:17:39,250
(The Capital is governed
by strict rules.)

283
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:40,639
(The Lower City,)

284
00:17:40,681 --> 00:17:41,729
(Middle City,)

285
00:17:41,771 --> 00:17:42,809
(Upper City,)

286
00:17:42,851 --> 00:17:43,830
(and Yuyou Village,)

287
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:46,099
(each separated)

288
00:17:46,141 --> 00:17:47,080
(by its own gates,)

289
00:17:47,910 --> 00:17:49,389
(and no ordinary people)

290
00:17:49,431 --> 00:17:51,160
(may pass through the gates
without a decree.)

291
00:17:52,450 --> 00:17:54,309
(To reach Yuyou Village,)

292
00:17:54,351 --> 00:17:55,620
(there is only one path.)

293
00:17:56,290 --> 00:17:57,700
(Enter the Ascension Trial.)

294
00:17:58,790 --> 00:17:59,929
(To enter the Trial,)

295
00:17:59,971 --> 00:18:00,830
(you just beat the drum
and nominate yourself.)

296
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:02,929
(No matter where you come from,)

297
00:18:02,971 --> 00:18:04,120
(only life and death matter.)

298
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,229
(Yuyou Village)
(Those who survive)

299
00:18:06,271 --> 00:18:07,580
(are the only ones who may rise.)
